PASS   agent funded
PASS   pool wasm      c48000491d222c2843cc065cd3cc719ec4e3a127325b353c94f3af8e1ff199d6
PASS   pool           CA2ENZ7WXFOEKALIOW7RQHHJZM36MVIT742XOEKSJCX4H57MSTQ7WHAT
PASS   smart account  CBEE2BL6L46GKJOV5Q5TZECLCR7UXNYAFLEGNFMNW3U4XJ3H2KIKEBM7
PASS   account funded 81000000 stroops (SAC CDLZFC3SYJYDZT7K67VZ75HPJVIEUVNIXF47ZG2FB2RMQQVU2HHGCYSC)
