PASS   CONTROL: supply of 20000000 permitted via ids [1,3] (no cap) ccbab9835d7f7f07a3644bb67f681bac6f4d8eec07ca88bddf32bcf007efb638
PASS   CAPPED: supply of 1000000 permitted via ids [1,2] e7092ed99735237889acd842b0acf5d11e7c1f87c4a8a18a32ab22deb4db4389
RESULT BOUND: over-cap supply DENIED #3221 (SpendingLimitExceeded).
